# Environment variables are per app — see:
#   apps/mobile/.env.example   (EXPO_PUBLIC_*  — public values only)
#   apps/admin/.env.example    (NEXT_PUBLIC_*  — public values only)
#
# Edge Function secrets are set with `npx supabase secrets set KEY=value` (never committed):
#   BILLPLZ_API_KEY, BILLPLZ_COLLECTION_ID, BILLPLZ_X_SIGNATURE_KEY, BILLPLZ_SANDBOX (true|false)
#   PAYMENT_RETURN_URL, PUSH_WEBHOOK_SECRET, EXPO_ACCESS_TOKEN
# The service-role key is injected into Edge Functions by Supabase and must never be put in an app.
